Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:18:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Phone header with its version; soft avatar tones;
 the shared FAB colours

The app header every Plait app has ("Phone" and the installed version,
muted) sits inside MainToolbar above the search field, so it slides away
with it when the dialpad opens. Letter tiles use plait-design's three soft
avatar tones; the in-call background keeps the strong colours
(plait_header_colors) because white text sits on it. The dialpad button
uses the primary container like PlaitFab (the support FAB stays round).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
